# Only the sources the build needs. The toolchain file is left out: the build image already is that toolchain.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
crates/*/tests/
crates/ui/bench/
!docs/brand-kit/title-select-tokens.css
# Title Select's licence, for the workbench's About page.
!LICENSE
# The clone-list pins, which the binary embeds, and the script that fetches what they pin.
!third_party/clone-lists/pins.toml
!tools/clone-lists/fetch
# Retool's licence, for the About page: the selection engine is a port of Retool.
!third_party/retool/LICENSE
# The stand-in for SDL that chdman is built with.
!tools/chdman/sdl-stub.c
